  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jpKtqf5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"75\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/443/937/pixil-frame-0-55.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"321\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">這是一款Minecraft模組，將寶石螃蟹加入了深淵維度，這些螃蟹身上帶有深淵維度的礦石。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/448/211/undergarden-crabs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1125\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">更新日誌</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:24px\">目前無更新。</span></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">適用於Minecraft 1.18.2及以上版本</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">需要安裝Undergarden模組&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">Undergarden</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">僅限Forge版本</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">歡迎留言回報錯誤</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">原始模組</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gemcrabs-gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gemcrabs-gobber</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
